{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01GQR7hkDE9XUDxF4cQ6Zjrm","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntiers:\n  best:\n    meaning: \"所有核心 claims (C1-C5) 全部成立，5-model 数据完整复现且 C4 model×type interaction 成为 star finding，perturbation control 完美通过，judge calibration 人类一致性高\"\n    key_assumptions:\n      - \"C1 binary effect 在 5 model 上全部显著 (p<0.0001)，效应量 ≥30pp\"\n      - \"C2 type hierarchy omnibus χ² 显著 (p<0.001)，3-tier 结构稳定，incompleteness 与 coreferential 差距 ≥15pp\"\n      - \"C3 layer effect 在 within-judge 子组分析中也达到显著 (p<0.05)，而非仅 pooled 显著\"\n      - \"C4 model×type interaction 中 auth_scope 跨模型极差 ≥40pp，incompleteness 保持 universally high (≥45%)\"\n      - \"plan_010 perturbation control 判定 PASS (Δ_perturb <5pp, CI 含 0)\"\n      - \"plan_009 judge calibration 人类标注 κ≥0.80，judge F1≥0.85\"\n      - \"C5 error analysis failure mode signatures 在 5 model 扩展后仍保持 type-specific 一致性\"\n    number_ranges:\n      C1_binary_effect_pp: [30, 40]\n      C1_mcnemar_OR: [12, 20]\n      C2_omnibus_chi2_p: [1e-6, 1e-4]\n      C2_cramers_V: [0.12, 0.20]\n      C2_incomp_minus_coref_pp: [18, 28]\n      C3_layer_gap_pp: [6, 14]\n      C3_within_judge_p: [0.001, 0.05]\n      C4_auth_scope_range_pp: [40, 55]\n      C4_incomp_range_pp: [10, 20]\n      C4_fleiss_kappa: [0.30, 0.45]\n      C5_awareness_rate_pct: [3, 8]\n      C5_surface_adoption_pct: [85, 95]\n      perturbation_delta_pp: [0, 5]\n      judge_human_kappa: [0.80, 0.95]\n      judge_F1: [0.85, 0.95]\n    narrative_direction: \"Differential Nocuity 框架完全成立。三层叙事：(1) policy ambiguity universally nocuous for LLM agents，causal evidence 最强（matched-pair + perturbation control PASS）；(2) type hierarchy + model×type interaction 揭示 safety training 的 selective mitigation 机制，auth_scope 是 canary type；(3) Ambiguity Blindness + Systematic Nocuity 扩展 Berry & Kamsties 理论。C3 within-judge 显著性让 layer effect 从 'suggestive' 升级为 confirmed，Disambiguation Channel Framework 获得更强支撑。所有 claims 原始强度发表，无需降级。EMNLP accept 概率最高。\"\n\n  median:\n    meaning: \"C1/C2/C4/C5 成立但部分效应量缩水，C3 layer effect 保持 fragile（within-judge 不显著），judge calibration 中等，需调整部分 claim 表述强度\"\n    key_assumptions:\n      - \"C1 binary effect 成立但效应量略低于 5-model 聚合值，部分模型 effect size 缩水 5-8pp\"\n      - \"C2 type hierarchy omnibus 显著但 V<0.15，3-tier 结构中 mid-tier 内部差异不显著\"\n      - \"C3 layer effect pooled 显著 (p<0.05) 但 within-judge 子组均不显著 (p>0.10)，只能报告 suggestive\"\n      - \"C4 model×type interaction 存在但 auth_scope 极差缩小至 30-40pp 范围\"\n      - \"plan_010 perturbation control 判定 PASS+caveat (Δ_perturb 5-10pp)\"\n      - \"plan_009 judge calibration κ=0.65-0.79，F1=0.75-0.84，部分 severity tier 分类不稳定\"\n      - \"C5 failure mode 5-model 扩展后，2-3 个 type 的 dominant mode 在新模型上不一致\"\n    number_ranges:\n      C1_binary_effect_pp: [25, 35]\n      C1_mcnemar_OR: [8, 15]\n      C2_omnibus_chi2_p: [1e-4, 0.01]\n      C2_cramers_V: [0.09, 0.15]\n      C2_incomp_minus_coref_pp: [12, 20]\n      C3_layer_gap_pp: [3, 8]\n      C3_within_judge_p: [0.10, 0.30]\n      C4_auth_scope_range_pp: [30, 45]\n      C4_incomp_range_pp: [15, 25]\n      C4_fleiss_kappa: [0.25, 0.40]\n      C5_awareness_rate_pct: [5, 15]\n      C5_surface_adoption_pct: [78, 90]\n      perturbation_delta_pp: [5, 10]\n      judge_human_kappa: [0.65, 0.79]\n      judge_F1: [0.75, 0.84]\n    narrative_direction: \"核心叙事保持但需降低三处 claim 强度：(1) C3 layer effect 从 'significant' 降为 'suggestive tendency'，Disambiguation Channel 从 explanatory framework 进一步降为 'observed pattern consistent with'，layer 部分移入 Discussion 而非 Results 的核心位置；(2) perturbation control 需报告 net effect (Δ_net = Δ_ambiguity - Δ_perturb)，C1 写 'ambiguity causes violations substantially beyond general prompt sensitivity' 而非 'ambiguity-specific'；(3) C5 failure mode 跨模型一致性从 '5/6 types converge' 改为 'majority of types show consistent signatures, with model-dependent variation in X types'。C4 model×type interaction 仍是 star finding 但需 soften auth_scope 的 safety training 解释（极差缩小意味着可能是 prompt format 差异而非 training 差异）。Title 可能需从 'Differential Vulnerability Profiles' 微调为更保守表述。仍可冲 EMNLP，但需补充 1-2 个 robustness check 作为 appendix。\"\n\n  worst:\n    meaning: \"C3 layer effect 不成立，C4 interaction 弱化到 borderline，perturbation control 暴露 confound，judge calibration 差，需 reframe 围绕 C1+C2+C5 的 universal nocuity + type taxonomy 贡献\"\n    key_assumptions:\n      - \"C1 binary effect 仍成立 (≥20pp) 但部分模型效应量大幅缩水\"\n      - \"C2 type hierarchy omnibus 显著但 V<0.10，TOST 在 ±15pp 下大部分 pair equivalent，类型差异弱\"\n      - \"C3 layer effect pooled 也不显著 (p>0.10)，spec vs ling 差异消失——layer framework 不成立\"\n      - \"C4 model×type interaction omnibus 显著但主要由单一模型 (e.g., Claude outlier) 驱动，移除后不显著\"\n      - \"plan_010 perturbation control 判定 CONDITIONAL 或 WARNING (Δ_perturb 10-20pp)，ambiguity-specific causal claim 被削弱\"\n      - \"plan_009 judge calibration κ<0.65，F1<0.75，LLM-as-judge 可靠性受质疑\"\n      - \"C5 failure mode 在 5-model 扩展后 type-specific signatures 不再 consistent，只剩 2-3 个 type 有清晰 pattern\"\n    number_ranges:\n      C1_binary_effect_pp: [18, 28]\n      C1_mcnemar_OR: [5, 10]\n      C2_omnibus_chi2_p: [0.001, 0.05]\n      C2_cramers_V: [0.06, 0.10]\n      C2_incomp_minus_coref_pp: [8, 15]\n      C3_layer_gap_pp: [-2, 5]\n      C3_within_judge_p: [0.10, 0.60]\n      C4_auth_scope_range_pp: [15, 30]\n      C4_incomp_range_pp: [20, 35]\n      C4_fleiss_kappa: [0.15, 0.30]\n      C5_awareness_rate_pct: [8, 20]\n      C5_surface_adoption_pct: [70, 85]\n      perturbation_delta_pp: [10, 20]\n      judge_human_kappa: [0.50, 0.64]\n      judge_F1: [0.60, 0.74]\n    narrative_direction: \"需要根本性 reframe，放弃 'Differential Nocuity' 和 layer hierarchy 作为核心叙事。新 angle：**Universal Nocuity + Type Taxonomy as Diagnostic Tool**。(1) 即使 perturbation baseline 较高，ambiguity 仍造成显著额外 violations (Δ_net ≥10pp)，但 framing 从 'ambiguity-specific causation' 转为 'ambiguity as a significant contributor among specification sensitivity factors'；(2) 放弃 C3 layer effect 和 Disambiguation Channel Framework，改为报告 null result（'contrary to expectations, spec/ling distinction does not predict violation severity'）；(3) C4 从 'model×type interaction reveals safety training mechanism' 降为 'models show some variation in type vulnerability, particularly for auth_scope, but the interaction is driven by outlier models and should be interpreted cautiously'；(4) 核心贡献重心移至 C1 (first causal quantification, even with perturbation caveat) + C2 (first 6-type taxonomy with operational definitions grounded in RE literature) + C5 (Ambiguity Blindness 作为 empirical finding，即使 type-specific signatures 弱化，<20% awareness + >70% surface adoption 仍有价值)；(5) Title 改为 'Policy Ambiguity Is Universally Nocuous for LLM Agents: A Causal Study with Type-Level Taxonomy'——去掉 'Differential' 和 'Model Architecture'。贡献定位从 mechanism 发现转向 measurement framework + taxonomy 贡献。仍冲 EMNLP，taxonomy + causal design + Ambiguity Blindness 三个 methodological/empirical 贡献足够，但 novelty claim 弱于 best/median。\"\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":18709,"cache_read_input_tokens":11447,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":18709},"output_tokens":9,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b6ffabf6-b547-4ef0-b9cd-25d02e926ac1","uuid":"eea9a77d-7a48-4d4b-b9f6-a4087c375f29"}
